OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 11, surrounded by glass
OL,4,Aafter brick attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum from East Yorkshire was left
OL,7,Fdistraught after two boys threw bricks
OL,8,Fat her house, smashing her disabled
OL,9,Fdaughter's bedroom window.
OL,11,FAbbie, 30, from Old Goole, had to move
OL,12,Fher 11-year-old daughter to safe
OL,13,Faccommodation after the incident on
OL,14,FTuesday evening left her surrounded by
OL,15,Fglass.
OL,17,F"I absolutely feel distraught. I'm
OL,18,Fscared. I don't know why this has
OL,19,Fhappened," Abbie said.
